  "prefLabel": "Mec 807.01 Initial Certification Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 807.01 Initial Certification Fee.\n\n(a) The fee for certification as a water treatment trainee shall be $30.00;\n\n(b) The fee for a 2-year certification as a water treatment technician shall be $60.00;\n\n(c) The fee for renewal of a certificate shall be $60.00.\n\n(d) The fees shall be non-refundable.\n\nSource. #13632, eff 7-19-23\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec800.html"
